EffectGraph is licensed under the MIT No Attribution License (MIT-0), below.
It covers the engine and everything built only from it:

  - the engine library: Graph/, Rendering/, Effects/, Engine/, pch_engine.*,
    Version.h (ShaderLabEngine.vcxproj)
  - the built-in effects: BuiltInEffects/ (BuiltInEffects.vcxproj)
  - EffectGraph.dll: EffectGraphDll/ (EffectGraph.vcxproj)
  - the effect compiler: EffectGraphCompile/ (EffectGraphCompile.vcxproj)
  - the MSBuild integration: build/EffectGraph.targets,
    build/EffectGraphBuiltIns.targets
  - the language bindings and packages: bindings/, packaging/

Everything else in this repository, the ShaderLab application, its headless
host, MCP broker, tests and Support/ library included, is under the MIT
License in LICENSE. EffectGraph contains no third-party source code; the
binaries compile in C++/WinRT headers (MIT, Microsoft Corporation).

